<Behavior #shell-runtime-facade-ports apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" version="1" (
  <Requirements [
    <Requirement #shell-runtime-must-prefer-narrow-domain-facade-ports (
      <Statement ?01M05F1P3KP15BT2D07J1CG3SD>
      系统应当让 shell/runtime entry 优先消费更窄的 domain runtime facade port，而不是继续直接拼接过多 AI orchestration internals。
      </?01M05F1P3KP15BT2D07J1CG3SD>
      <Suites [
        <Suite { name = "shell-runtime-must-prefer-narrow-domain-facade-ports" } (
          <Cases [
            <Case #terminal-runtime-consumes-narrowed-domain-facade { name = "Terminal runtime consumes narrowed domain facade" } [
              <Then ?01M05F1P3KP15BT2D07J1CG3SE>
              它应优先通过更窄的 domain facade port 获得能力
              </?01M05F1P3KP15BT2D07J1CG3SE>
              <Then ?01M05F1P3KP15BT2D07J1CG3SF>
              不应继续直接持有过多 orchestrator/coordinator/organization 真相
              </?01M05F1P3KP15BT2D07J1CG3SF>
            ] (
              <Given ?01M05F1P3KP15BT2D07J1CG3SG>
              `TerminalRuntime` 需要执行 turn bridge、projection bridge 与 runtime lifecycle glue
              </?01M05F1P3KP15BT2D07J1CG3SG>
              <When ?01M05F1P3KP15BT2D07J1CG3SH>
              完成本能力
              </?01M05F1P3KP15BT2D07J1CG3SH>
            )>
          ]>
        )>
      ]>
    )>
    <Requirement #shell-facade-cutover-must-preserve-adoption-behavior (
      <Statement ?01M05F1P3KP15BT2D07J1CG3SJ>
      系统应当在 shell facade 收紧后继续保持 terminal/tui/headless adoption 主路径不回归。
      </?01M05F1P3KP15BT2D07J1CG3SJ>
      <Suites [
        <Suite { name = "shell-facade-cutover-must-preserve-adoption-behavior" } (
          <Cases [
            <Case #shell-adoption-still-works-after-facade-narrowing { name = "Shell adoption still works after facade narrowing" } [
              <Then ?01M05F1P3KP15BT2D07J1CG3SK>
              focused tests 应继续通过
              </?01M05F1P3KP15BT2D07J1CG3SK>
              <Then ?01M05F1P3KP15BT2D07J1CG3SM>
              shell 不得回退到本地默认 AI 语义
              </?01M05F1P3KP15BT2D07J1CG3SM>
            ] (
              <Given ?01M05F1P3KP15BT2D07J1CG3SN>
              terminal/tui/headless 当前已消费 assembly result 与 runtime bridge
              </?01M05F1P3KP15BT2D07J1CG3SN>
              <When ?01M05F1P3KP15BT2D07J1CG3SP>
              完成本能力
              </?01M05F1P3KP15BT2D07J1CG3SP>
            )>
          ]>
        )>
      ]>
    )>
    <Requirement #shell-runtime-facade-exposes-runtime-context-control-views (
      <Statement ?01M05F1P3KP15BT2D07J1CG3SQ>
      系统应当让 shell/runtime facade 暴露正式的 work context、continuation baseline 与 prompt/context 相关 runtime-first 视图，而不是要求 terminal 侧散读底层状态。
      </?01M05F1P3KP15BT2D07J1CG3SQ>
      <Suites [
        <Suite { name = "shell-runtime-facade-exposes-runtime-context-control-views" } (
          <Cases [
            <Case #terminal-facing-shell-facade-can-read-runtime-context-control-state { name = "Terminal-facing shell facade can read runtime context control state" } [
              <Then ?01M05F1P3KP15BT2D07J1CG3SR>
              facade SHALL 提供稳定的 runtime-first 读取入口
              </?01M05F1P3KP15BT2D07J1CG3SR>
              <Then ?01M05F1P3KP15BT2D07J1CG3SS>
              调用方不应继续直接拼接底层 actor/runtime 真相
              </?01M05F1P3KP15BT2D07J1CG3SS>
            ] (
              <Given ?01M05F1P3KP15BT2D07J1CG3ST>
              terminal、headless 或 shell bridge 需要读取当前 session 的 work context、continuation baseline 或相关 prompt state
              </?01M05F1P3KP15BT2D07J1CG3ST>
              <When ?01M05F1P3KP15BT2D07J1CG3SV>
              它们通过 shell runtime facade 获取这些信息
              </?01M05F1P3KP15BT2D07J1CG3SV>
            )>
          ]>
        )>
      ]>
    )>
  ]>
)>
